OL,3,AHealey pledges growth but acknowledges
OL,4,Ahigh government borrowing costs in
OL,5,Afirst speech as chancellor
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey is giving his
OL,8,Ffirst major speech since taking on the
OL,9,Frole in July - watch live above
OL,11,FHe says UK businesses are ready to
OL,12,F"seize the opportunity of new tech" and
OL,13,Fthat there's been an increase in
OL,14,Fproductivity after decades of lagging
OL,15,Fbehind other countries
OL,17,FHealey's expected to unveil a #150m
OL,18,Ffund for fast-growing companies in the
OL,19,Fnorth of England
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
