OL,3,AHealey pledges growth but acknowledges
OL,4,Ahigh government borrowing costs in
OL,5,Afirst speech as chancellor
OL,6,
OL,7,FSince taking office, PM Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fhas called for "growth in every
OL,9,Fpostcode" and said he will devolve
OL,10,Fpower from Whitehall to other parts of
OL,11,Fthe UK
OL,13,FJust last week, UK borrowing costs rose
OL,14,Fagain, with interest rates on 10-year
OL,15,Fdebt reaching an 18-year high - this
OL,16,Fgraph shows the latest figures
OL,18,FHealey will deliver his first Budget on
OL,19,F28 October - which, he says, will be
OL,20,F"built on fiscal discipline"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
